$ docs/architecture.md §7 roadmap step 3: "get fizzbuzz.fly running end-to-end
$ through LLVM to a native binary" using only scalars (num/yn/tex-literal),
$ arithmetic, if/orif/ifnot, while, job/give, and show.

job fizz(n) {
    if n % 15 == 0 {
        show("FizzBuzz")
    }
    orif n % 3 == 0 {
        show("Fizz")
    }
    orif n % 5 == 0 {
        show("Buzz")
    }
    ifnot {
        show(n)
    }
}

i = 1
while i <= 30 {
    fizz(i)
    i = i + 1
}
